  "title": "No Fuss Shredded Beef Tacos",
  "description": "A cup of coffee, tomatoes, and chili seasoning bring their flavors to slow-cooked Mexican-inspired beef. Serve the meat shredded in warm tortillas with your favorite toppings.",
